config MTK_CONSYS_WLAN
	bool "MediaTek MT6853 consys Wi-Fi (gen4m, AXI/SOC2)"
	depends on MTK_CONSYS_WMT && CFG80211=y && NET
	select WIRELESS_EXT
	select WEXT_PRIV
	default n
	help
	  The vendor gen4m WLAN driver for the MT6853 connectivity
	  combo chip, built in and adapted to mainline cfg80211.

	  It stays dormant until the WMT core is enabled (mtk_consys.hw=1)
	  and user space writes 1 to /dev/wmtWifi; probing only maps the
	  CSR window and registers callbacks with WMT. The chip is powered
	  and the firmware downloaded only on that write.

	  If unsure, say N.
